# deps
node_modules/
# NOT committed on purpose: a committed lockfile makes Cloudflare Pages run `npm ci`,
# which fails the build if the lock drifts from package.json. This exact issue broke
# the shopagni-static deploy on 2026-07-22. Leave it untracked.
package-lock.json

